mixin Testimonial
	+Section('container-small px-lg-7 px-xxl-3').pt-15.pb-0#testimonials
		.row
			.col-12.text-center.mb-8
				h4.text-primary.fw-bolder.mb-3 Testimonials
				h2.mb-3.text-body-emphasis.lh-base Trusted by growing businesses
				p.mb-5 See how Zairflow has helped businesses scale their e-commerce operations and achieve remarkable growth.

		.row.g-4
			.col-lg-4
				.card.h-100.border.border-translucent
					.card-body.p-4
						.d-flex.align-items-center.mb-3
							img.rounded-circle.me-3(src=`${CWD}assets/img/team/15.webp` width="48" height="48" alt='')
							div
								h6.mb-1.fw-bold Sarah Johnson
								p.mb-0.text-body-secondary CEO, Fashion Forward
						p.mb-0 "Zairflow transformed our business. We went from managing 3 stores manually to scaling to 15 stores effortlessly. The multi-tenant architecture is exactly what we needed."

			.col-lg-4
				.card.h-100.border.border-translucent
					.card-body.p-4
						.d-flex.align-items-center.mb-3
							img.rounded-circle.me-3(src=`${CWD}assets/img/team/16.webp` width="48" height="48" alt='')
							div
								h6.mb-1.fw-bold Michael Chen
								p.mb-0.text-body-secondary Founder, TechGear Pro
						p.mb-0 "The analytics and reporting features are incredible. We can track performance across all our stores in real-time. Zairflow has been a game-changer for our business."

			.col-lg-4
				.card.h-100.border.border-translucent
					.card-body.p-4
						.d-flex.align-items-center.mb-3
							img.rounded-circle.me-3(src=`${CWD}assets/img/team/17.webp` width="48" height="48" alt='')
							div
								h6.mb-1.fw-bold Emily Rodriguez
								p.mb-0.text-body-secondary COO, Home Essentials
						p.mb-0 "Security was our biggest concern when scaling to multiple stores. Zairflow's enterprise-grade security gives us peace of mind while growing our business."

